Circuits that must be rejected, each paired with the violation codes it
should produce.

Codes come from ../../spec/circuit.spec.json. A fixture may not invent one.

Split by phase, per ADR-0005 section 6. Semantic fixtures are exercised by
both languages. Shape fixtures -- anything the schema itself rejects, reported
as SHAPE_INVALID -- are backend-only until the frontend gains a runtime shape
validator in Milestone 3.

Empty until Milestone 2.
